{
 "v": 1,
 "essay": "Justification of Being Wanted Through The Commercialization of Taste.md",
 "spans": [
  {
   "text": "We feel so drawn to project out aspects of the self onto social media.",
   "node": "Social Media Addiction as a Byproduct of Consciousness Projection",
   "kind": "p"
  },
  {
   "text": "Of course there is nothing wrong with this,",
   "node": "Deep Work",
   "kind": "q"
  },
  {
   "text": "our ancestors have been doing it since the dawn of humanity.",
   "node": "Technological Maximalism is Inherent To Evolution",
   "kind": "p"
  },
  {
   "text": "We are social creatures and so naturally we look for social advantages to incorporate within ourselves.",
   "node": "The Human Condition is Social Condition",
   "kind": "p"
  },
  {
   "text": "This leads us to algorithms that take advantage of a natural psychological tendency,",
   "node": "Primal design principles",
   "kind": "p"
  },
  {
   "text": "Such that, we seek to capture our own version of the attention we see others get by trying to emulate the ways in which they show they are different. We are being algorithmically sold taste as the differentiator that will make us feel wanted.",
   "node": "Superiority Through Adherence To Shared Esoteric Principles",
   "kind": "p"
  },
  {
   "text": "[[Superiority Through Adherence To Shared Esoteric Principles]]",
   "node": "Superiority Through Adherence To Shared Esoteric Principles",
   "kind": "q"
  }
 ],
